5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we need to commit to a destination before bookings open, we should prioritize cost and logistics. I want to ensure we have a realistic budget this time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. Efficiency is key. To get a clear picture of the costs, I suggest we look into the actual spending from previous years and the current rates for public facilities.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree that budget is important, but we also need to consider the social dynamics of the group. I want to ensure the destination encourages better integration among the different year-groups this time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that budget and social harmony are important. However, I am also concerned about the quality of our rest and the daily schedule. I believe we should look into the actual conditions of the stay.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with the need for a realistic budget. However, we must also be precise about how those costs are distributed and managed to avoid any discrepancies. Let's gather the necessary data first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll look into the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I need a precise understanding of the fixed costs before we propose any figures.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and ""Attendance sheets for the away camps."" It is important to understand the actual workload involved in managing the camp.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will look into ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Membership list against first-train times."" We need to ensure the location is accessible and promotes better interaction among members.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland"" and the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings"" to see how other groups managed their stays and the availability of facilities.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will look into ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Vacation timetable for the club's own hall."" I want to compare the actual historical spending against our internal options to ensure financial fairness.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we have all selected our research topics, I believe we have a comprehensive plan. Let's proceed with gathering the data so we can analyze the costs and logistics objectively.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Indeed. Once we have the data, we can determine which destination minimizes unnecessary burdens on the organizers while remaining within our budget. I look forward to the results.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. While the logistics are essential, I hope the data on member accessibility and senior feedback will help us choose a place that truly brings the club together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I hope the information from the other clubs provides some insight into the actual environment of the inland sites. A peaceful atmosphere is essential for everyone to perform their best.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. Once we have the data, we can identify any hidden costs or inconsistencies in how we've handled expenses in the past. Let's ensure the final decision is based on transparent and accurate figures.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Transparency is the only way to avoid mistakes. Let's wait for the findings and then evaluate the options based on the hard data we've gathered.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
