22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us wait for the information to be compiled. I believe the data will reveal the most sustainable path forward for all of us.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
