24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let's see what the data tells us. I'm particularly interested in whether we can find a balance between convenience and a setting that encourages genuine interaction.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
