26,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us wait for the results. I hope we can find a destination that allows everyone to rest deeply and maintain their composure throughout the training.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
